==English==

[[Image:Hdd od srodka.jpg|thumb|A hard disk drive]]

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|head=[[hard]] [[drive]]}}

# {{computing}} A device used for storing large amounts of [[data]] for a [[computer]] that persist while the computer is turned off.

====Synonyms====
* [[hard disc]], [[hard disk]]
* [[hard disc drive]], [[hard disk drive]]
* [[HD]], [[HDD]] {{qualifier|abbreviation}}

